  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery Kits Bank: Saving Mothers and newborns!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On the 26/08/2023, during our distribution of emergency delivery kits to 10 needy women, a recipient told us that she was diagnosed HIV+ during her last pregnancy. Because she did not have money to purchase delivery kits, she ended up having home delivery, at the mercy of neighbours. Two years later, her daughter was also diagnosed of HIV.   Our delivery kits bank banks delivery kits to encourage hospital births and save mothers and babies, regardless of HIV status. Support us support women!</narrative>
  </description>
